I refactored the validation configuration a little bit. You can now set your own 
flags using the following example:

final Mailer mailer = new Mailer(host, 25, username, password);
// allow domain literals and quoted identifiers
mailer.setEmailAddressValidationCriteria(new EmailAddressValidationCriteria(true, 
true));
mailer.sendMail(email);
